                                                "sense_id": "7e46ceb2-ff0b-3f63-ade2-dcfdcffe1db7",
                                                "text": "Nicotine, a stimulant found in tobacco, long used by Native Americans, taught scientists about the existence of our own nicotinic receptors, which influence neuronal excitement."
